Text:
Soon the sky is teeming with ships, and the vault crammed with bodies. 

Their datapads flicker with the whispers of a dead society, sharing its last breaths, fragmentary though they might be.

These Houses have improved their <h>Technology</h> score:
{listAsList(PlayerFactionHouses)}
{listAsList(NearbyHouses)}

In weeks, their ships have formed a shanty-town around the vault entrance. Visitors are only too eager to cram viridium into the hands of your guards and push inside the threshold. 

You hear snatches of conversation about the wonders they’ve discovered, but soon they are shooed away: their time - and their coin - is up.

